      "writtenOn": "2026-02-25T19:47:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would agree that indexing the wrong texture would be a pretty extreme visual glitch. However it is not that we are saying that these failures do not exist but more that they are classified as being likely to cause some visual aberration.\n\nAs for \" visual calculations instead of financial or medical calculations.\" if the device you are using does not pass CTS fully without exceptions you could have unacceptable failures.",
      "parentUuid": "99c99831_f0c4238a",
      "revId": "6cb839138a48fe868e879a629aee893b05238991",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
